                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5e79898c-752c-3b7b-ab44-45ccb1339054",
                        "entry_id": "cb76f3ad-f073-32c9-83e1-2eb878fd346a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "simulierte virtuelle Umgebung, die Benutzer betreten können"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "75b9fe75-45a1-438a-bb60-86cde9cb7c98",
                                "sense_id": "5e79898c-752c-3b7b-ab44-45ccb1339054",
                                "text": "Der Cyberspace ist eine faszinierende Welt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cfe836d5-3954-4a6f-ad2f-99e4f726eb0b",
                                "sense_id": "5e79898c-752c-3b7b-ab44-45ccb1339054",
                                "text": "„Doch mit dem, was am 30. Januar 1945 ab einundzwanzig Uhr sechzehn tatsächlich auf der Wilhelm Gustloff geschah, hatten die sich im Cyberspace übertrumpfenden Zahlen wenig zu tun.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a313793-fcea-432e-afe3-e12f00d222fd",
                                "sense_id": "5e79898c-752c-3b7b-ab44-45ccb1339054",
                                "text": "„Manche Themen dieser auf Kohlepapier vervielfältigten Blätter haben auch den Sprung in das Zeitalter des Cyberspace geschafft.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2972cae1-e3ca-3705-8a99-86584c7ab8ac",
                        "entry_id": "cb76f3ad-f073-32c9-83e1-2eb878fd346a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "das Internet als virtueller Aufenthaltsort"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "übertragen, abstrakt"
                        ],
                        "examples": [],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2b506d67-0e8e-436c-9bbc-cfda76df26ab",
                        "source_entry_id": "cb76f3ad-f073-32c9-83e1-2eb878fd346a",
                        "source_sense_id": "5e79898c-752c-3b7b-ab44-45ccb1339054",
                        "source_sense_description": "simulierte virtuelle Umgebung, die Benutzer betreten können",
                        "target_lang_word": "cyberspace",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cyberspace",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08cdfa72-c016-3b64-b4dd-ff1178e6ed53",
                                        "entry_id": "66d6bc96-57a2-3742-b2b3-d90edee6505d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A world of information accessed through the Internet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0900a660-3664-3705-a689-622dc32c5194",
                                        "entry_id": "66d6bc96-57a2-3742-b2b3-d90edee6505d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The Internet as a whole."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "countable",
                                            "dated",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e207f759-8ea4-4d61-96c0-644b9c4dfeab",
                                                "sense_id": "0900a660-3664-3705-a689-622dc32c5194",
                                                "text": "Meanwhile, the pioneers of the computer-mediated communication networks collectively referred to as cyberspace are not willing to wait. Employing whatever tools they can find, they are constantly pushing the techno-cultural envelope. Life in cyberspace is often conducted in primitive, frontier conditions, but it is a life which, at its best, is more egalitarian than elitist, and more decentralized than hierarchical."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d015e1db-259c-444c-bdee-aaf1a7f1cd11",
                                                "sense_id": "0900a660-3664-3705-a689-622dc32c5194",
                                                "text": "However, some have accused cyberspace of provoking a dangerous collapse in the old order of civilised society. The shift in the balance of power online has given rise to a more powerful concern: the rise of the uncivil web."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1410096-ec24-4a60-bea3-21d8d2b46d46",
                                                "sense_id": "0900a660-3664-3705-a689-622dc32c5194",
                                                "text": "If, as we knew with increasing certainty, Russia, China, North Korea, Iran, and others were contesting us in cyberspace, it was time to fight back."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba6bd967-9170-4fb6-82e0-66f0990232d3",
                                                "sense_id": "0900a660-3664-3705-a689-622dc32c5194",
                                                "text": "“We call on all states, including China, to uphold their international commitments and obligations and to act responsibly in the international system, including in cyberspace,” according to a statement from NATO."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dab459ff-918d-3db4-ba48-00da9d9b5f65",
                                        "entry_id": "66d6bc96-57a2-3742-b2b3-d90edee6505d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A three-dimensional representation of virtual space in a computer network."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1eae9408-df66-43b8-ae5e-220d13990056",
                                                "sense_id": "dab459ff-918d-3db4-ba48-00da9d9b5f65",
                                                "text": "I knew every chip in Bobby's simulator by heart; it looked like your workaday Ono-Sendai VII, the ‘Cyberspace Seven’, but I'd rebuilt it so many times that you'd have had a hard time finding a square millimetre of factory circuitry in all that silicon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b681c6b9-531e-429d-bee1-e6b60018dbf3",
                                                "sense_id": "dab459ff-918d-3db4-ba48-00da9d9b5f65",
                                                "text": "Cyberspace. A consensual hallucination experienced daily by billions of legitimate operators, in every nation, by children being taught mathematical concepts… A graphic representation of data abstracted from banks of every computer in the human system. Unthinkable complexity. Lines of light ranged in the nonspace of the mind, clusters and constellations of data. Like city lights, receding…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "95d37d20-6481-45a1-a8e5-747c03a5bd60",
                        "source_entry_id": "cb76f3ad-f073-32c9-83e1-2eb878fd346a",
                        "source_sense_id": "5e79898c-752c-3b7b-ab44-45ccb1339054",
                        "source_sense_description": "simulierte virtuelle Umgebung, die Benutzer betreten können",
                        "target_lang_word": "cyberespace",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cyberespace",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42bb489e-2267-323e-8e89-7d08f532430c",
                                        "entry_id": "03a15741-90de-3302-8cb4-6d8349c9a7b8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Espace constitué par les infrastructures interconnectées relevant des technologies de l’information, notamment l’internet, et par les données qui y sont traitées."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b12500b2-6b34-4a48-90c2-e3c7dbc6897a",
                                                "sense_id": "42bb489e-2267-323e-8e89-7d08f532430c",
                                                "text": "— Bien sur répondit Harry. Ils sont en mesure d'identifier et neutraliser tous les chevaux de Troie recensés. Mais sont incapables de reconnaître ce qu'ils n'ont jamais vu. Or ce RAT (Remote Access Trojan) est tout nouveau, il sort tout droit du cyberespace."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1448d85-fff6-4217-aa12-8b7e74d46037",
                                                "sense_id": "42bb489e-2267-323e-8e89-7d08f532430c",
                                                "text": "De plus, nous renforcerons notre collaboration visant à faire respecter les normes internationales relatives au comportement responsable des États dans le cyberespace, et nous entendons également collaborer davantage dans le cadre d’initiatives de renforcement des capacités et de la détermination des mesures réglementaires dans le domaine de la cybernétique."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1baeb640-502a-3acb-bf53-241cc5565296",
                                        "entry_id": "03a15741-90de-3302-8cb4-6d8349c9a7b8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Espace internet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6bae2e01-5ec4-496f-a7bb-e2f3a865c487",
                                                "sense_id": "1baeb640-502a-3acb-bf53-241cc5565296",
                                                "text": "Depuis maintenant trois ans, notre commune a mis en place un ensemble de cyberespaces pour lutter contre la fracture numérique, au service de la population dans les quartiers, aussi en répondant à des besoins spécifiques, de la petite enfance jusqu’aux seniors et aussi aux mal-voyants."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "923c8545-d24e-46d3-b8bd-168d6e92b983",
                        "source_entry_id": "cb76f3ad-f073-32c9-83e1-2eb878fd346a",
                        "source_sense_id": "5e79898c-752c-3b7b-ab44-45ccb1339054",
